'' Decision D3: the emitted symbol name must be BYTE-IDENTICAL to fbc's. A name that
'' differs by one character does not fail loudly -- it fails at link time in someone
'' else's project, against a library tiko-lang never saw.
''
'' The full 60-name differential against fbc's own object file is
'' tools/gen/check-mangle.sh, which needs fbc present. This test is the part that
'' runs without it: the shapes whose rules were hardest to establish.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-mangle tests/mangle/src/probe.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: PLAIN
'' EXPECT-OUT: CFunc
'' EXPECT-OUT: my_alias
'' EXPECT-OUT: _Z4SOLOi
'' EXPECT-OUT: _Z10lower_casei
'' EXPECT-OUT: _ZN2TB3B07Eu7INTEGER
'' EXPECT-OUT: _ZN2TB3B20EPKi
'' EXPECT-OUT: _ZN2TB3B24EPPFvvE
'' EXPECT-OUT: _ZN5SUBST2S3EP3UDTS1_S1_
'' EXPECT-OUT: _ZN5SUBST2S7E3UDTPS0_S0_
'' EXPECT-OUT: _ZN1WC1Ei
'' EXPECT-OUT: _ZN1WD1Ev
'' EXPECT-OUT: _ZN1W11SIZE__set__Ei
'' EXPECT-OUT: _ZN1WaSERS_
'' EXPECT-OUT: _ZN1Wcv8FBSTRINGEv
'' EXPECT-OUT: _ZNK1W2CFEv
'' EXPECT-NOT: HIDDEN
